---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Free Website Teardown, Sioux Falls | Couch & Craft"
description: "Send me your website and I'll record a short video showing what's costing you calls. Free, and no pitch unless you ask."
crumb: "Free teardown"
cta: false
---
<section class="page-hero band--navy" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner flow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Free</p>
    <h1 id="page-heading">Send me your website. I'll tell you what's costing you calls.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__sub">A 10-minute recorded video walking through the fixes that matter most. No pitch unless you ask.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="example-heading">
  <div class="container{% if site.teardown.videoUrl %} two-up{% endif %}">
    <div class="flow">
      <h2 id="example-heading">What a teardown looks like</h2>
      <p class="lead">I open your site the way a customer would, on a phone and on a laptop, and talk through what I see. You get the video and a short list of what to fix first. Do them yourself, hand them to whoever built the site, or ask me.</p>
    </div>
    {%- if site.teardown.videoUrl %}
    <p><a class="button" href="{{ site.teardown.videoUrl }}" rel="noopener">Watch an example teardown</a></p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--white" id="request" aria-labelledby="request-heading">
  <div class="container home-form__inner">
    <div class="flow">
      <h2 id="request-heading">Request your teardown</h2>
      <p>Just the address and where to send the video.</p>
    </div>
    {% set form = { id: "teardown-form", type: "teardown", submitLabel: "Request my teardown" } %}
    {% include "partials/form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
